## 8. CPU workload balancing — **dev machine**

| What | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **When** | Before deploy, EAS build, FB multipage, full frontend rebuild, ffmpeg batch, or 3+ heavy subagents on owner PC |
| **Must** | Run `npm run ops:cpu-status`; enqueue heavy work when CPU ≥ 85% or ≥ 8 heavy node jobs |
| **Never** | Parallel deploy + EAS + FB multipage on same PC; FB multipage without valid token or >1 instance |
| **Rule** | `.cursor/rules/cpu-workload-balancing.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`) |
| **Queue** | `backend/scripts/cpuAwareTaskQueue.mjs` — `ops:cpu-queue-enqueue`, `ops:cpu-queue-run` |
| **Cleanup** | `backend/scripts/stopStaleHeavyProcesses.mjs` — `ops:stop-stale-heavy-processes` |
| **Runbook** | `DOCS/CPU_WORKLOAD_BALANCING.md` |

**Agent checks after Cursor updates:** confirm rule file exists; run `ops:cpu-status` before starting heavy jobs; use queue when blocked.
